<p>Tippah County has five incorporated municipalities — Ripley, Walnut, Blue Mountain, Falkner and Dumas — along with a census-designated place at Chalybeate and a scattering of unincorporated communities that still anchor a school, a church or a crossroads. RCTV19 covers all of them.</p>

<p>Each profile below collects the numbers worth knowing, the history behind the name, the schools and the phone numbers residents actually need. For county-wide information, see the <a href="/tippah-county/">Tippah County guide</a>.</p>

